    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Load policies\nLesson 4.4, the loading pipeline (run once per document version).\nManual Trigger → download the policy PDF from Google Drive → Supabase Vector Store · Insert Documents (table documents) with Embeddings, Default Data Loader (Binary, metadata source + version) and Recursive Character Text Splitter (500 / 80).\n\n**Credentials:** Google Drive OAuth2 (select it in the HTTP Request node), Supabase (project URL + service role key, credential only), OpenAI (embeddings).\n**Replace:** YOUR_POLICY_FILE_ID (the PDF's Drive file ID).\n\nRun the Supabase LangChain setup SQL first (vector extension, documents table, match_documents, vector size 1536 for text-embedding-3-small).",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "78d734fd-2db2-4c8a-9408-415b24c11821",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
